(68, 1, 11, 'Navratan', 'navratan-19', NULL, NULL, '<p><strong>\"NAVRATAN JEWELS\" </strong><br></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Hanif Presents \"Navratan Jewels\"<br>A Heritage Bridal Jewellery Collection, as timeless as the art of jewel making itself.<br><br></p>\n<p>Traditionally crafted with<br><strong>“Nau Ratans” or “Nine Gems”</strong><br><br></p>\n<p>The combination of these nine gems is said to be ravishingly spellinding and auspicious. A perfect and essential part of every traditional bridal attire. Visit our stores today to explore more!</p>', 'uploads/product/Navratan_20250628_143416.jpg', NULL, 'published', '', 'Discover the exquisite Navratan Collection by Hanif Jewellery and Watches, Pakistan\'s top jeweller. This stunning collection is traditionally crafted with the enchanting Nau Ratan, meaning \"nine gems,\" each representing a unique celestial influence. The Navratan Collection is more than just an accessory; it is an essential element of every traditional bridal ensemble, embodying elegance and cultural heritage. Adorn yourself with these timeless pieces and let the brilliance of the nine gems illuminate your special day with unparalleled grace and beauty.', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, '1', 0.00, 0, 0, '0', '0', '0', '2025-06-28 14:34:16', '2025-06-28 14:34:16'),
