(400, 1, 9, 'Valentine Jewels', 'valentine-ring-5', NULL, NULL, '<p>The diamond-encrusted embossed four-leaf clover is a token of scarcity and luck, painstakingly crafted to embody the spirit of prosperity in its radiant loveliness. Every single diamond is carefully set upon the dainty leaves, reflecting the attention to detail and craftsmanship involved in making such a masterpiece. The juxtaposition of the shimmering diamonds sets a stunning visual effect that makes hearts pound and pulses race. The opulence and elegance that it portrays command attention and admiration from everyone who lays eyes on it.</p>', 'uploads/product/Valentine Jewels_20250628_150431.jpg', NULL, 'published', '', 'Introducing the Valentine Jewels by Hanif Jewellery and Watches, the top jewellers of Islamabad. This exquisite collection embodies love, affection, and a promise that transcends time. Discover the secrets of devotion and elegance hidden within each piece, designed to celebrate the most cherished moments of your life.', NULL, 200000.00, 0.00, 0.00, '1', 0.00, 0, 0, '0', '0', '1', '2025-06-28 15:04:31', '2025-06-28 15:04:31'),
