(404, 1, 9, 'Valentine Jewels', 'valentine-ring-1', NULL, NULL, '<p><strong>RING<br><br>Valentines Jewels Hanif!<br></strong>A Sweet Love Story! Our Valentine’s Collection is an ensemble of exotic and creative expressions for the season of love!<strong><br></strong></p>', 'uploads/product/Valentine Jewels_20250628_150436.jpg', NULL, 'published', '', 'Introducing the Valentine Jewels by Hanif Jewellery and Watches, the top jewellers of Islamabad. This exquisite collection embodies love, affection, and a promise that transcends time. Discover the secrets of devotion and elegance hidden within each piece, designed to celebrate the most cherished moments of your life.', NULL, 200000.00, 0.00, 0.00, '1', 0.00, 0, 0, '0', '0', '1', '2025-06-28 15:04:36', '2025-06-28 15:04:36'),
(405, 1, 9, 'Valentine Jewels', 'valentine-ring', NULL, NULL, '<p>The heart-embossed ring with tiny diamonds is a gorgeous piece of jewellery that emanates romance and elegance. The fineness of the detailing and the craftsmanship of the embossing gave the ring a gorgeous texture that provides depth and dimension to the ring. The small diamonds that trim the heart shape further add to its attractiveness, giving it a dash of sparkle and sophistication. This ring is not only jewellery, but it is also an emblem of commitment and love, and as such, the ultimate gift for that special someone or a prized element to add to any jewelry box. Its enduring style and exceptional beauty render it a genuinely memorable and extraordinary piece.</p>', 'uploads/product/Valentine Jewels_20250628_150437.jpg', NULL, 'published', '', 'Introducing the Valentine Jewels by Hanif Jewellery and Watches, the top jewellers of Islamabad. This exquisite collection embodies love, affection, and a promise that transcends time. Discover the secrets of devotion and elegance hidden within each piece, designed to celebrate the most cherished moments of your life.', NULL, 200000.00, 0.00, 0.00, '1', 0.00, 0, 0, '0', '0', '1', '2025-06-28 15:04:38', '2025-06-28 15:04:38'),
(406, 1, 9, 'Valentine Jewels', 'valentine-jewelry-10', NULL, NULL, '<p>The impeccable clarity diamond ring in a round shape is characterized by dramatic sophistication and luxury. Each cut on the diamond sparkles as the light touches it, casting an entrancingly brilliant light effect that will stop people in their tracks. The diamond has an impeccable clarity without any defects that can compromise its flawless look. This ring is worn by those who live in the limelight and have no fear of making a strong statement. With every hand movement, this ring attracts all eyes to its dazzling brilliance. A real showstopper that will have observers in awe with envy.</p>', 'uploads/product/Valentine Jewels_20250628_150439.png', NULL, 'published', '', '', NULL, 88000.00, 0.00, 0.00, '1', 0.00, 0, 0, '0', '0', '1', '2025-06-28 15:04:39', '2025-06-28 15:04:39'),
(407, 1, 9, 'Valentine Jewels', 'valentine-jewelry-9', NULL, NULL, '<p>The diamond-encrusted embossed four-leaf clover is a token of scarcity and luck, painstakingly crafted to embody the spirit of prosperity in its radiant loveliness. Every single diamond is carefully set upon the dainty leaves, reflecting the attention to detail and craftsmanship involved in making such a masterpiece. The juxtaposition of the shimmering diamonds sets a stunning visual effect that makes hearts pound and pulses race. The opulence and elegance that it portrays command attention and admiration from everyone who lays eyes on it.</p>', 'uploads/product/Valentine Jewels_20250628_150440.png', NULL, 'published', '', '', NULL, 40000.00, 0.00, 0.00, '1', 0.00, 0, 0, '0', '0', '1', '2025-06-28 15:04:41', '2025-06-28 15:04:41'),
(408, 1, 9, 'Valentine Jewels', 'valentine-jewelry-8', NULL, NULL, '<p>The three brilliant blue sapphires set in a heart-shaped ring, lined with sparkling diamonds along the band, speak of eternal refinement and poise. Each sapphire has a unique shade of profound cerulean, signifying trust, loyalty, and honesty. The heart shape is representative of love and compassion, which makes this ring an exceedingly emotional piece of jewelry. The diamonds along the edges of the band bring an air of luxury and glamour to the ring, making it an overall aesthetically pleasing item.<br><br>                         This stunning ring gets attention and exudes respect from everyone who lays eyes on it. It is not only jewelry; it is a declaration of power, beauty, and passion that oozes confidence and seduction to everyone who wears it.</p>', 'uploads/product/Valentine Jewels_20250628_150442.png', NULL, 'published', 'Valentine Jewels', '', NULL, 57000.00, 0.00, 0.00, '1', 0.00, 0, 0, '0', '0', '1', '2025-06-28 15:04:42', '2025-06-28 15:04:42'),
(409, 1, 9, 'Valentine Jewels', 'valentine-jewelry-7', NULL, NULL, '<p>The diamond-encrusted butterfly-embossed ring presents an aura of subtle sophistication and elegance. The hypnotic grace of the delicate butterfly design highlights the owner\'s affinity for everything beautiful and ethereal. Every diamond that decorates the band shines like a star in the evening sky, bestowing a touch of glamour and opulence upon this already captivating piece. As light plays against the glimmering stones, it produces an eye-dazzling spectacle that enchants witnesses and leaves them agog. This ring is more than simply a piece of jewelry; it is a testament to elegance and sophistication, an affirmation of the wearer\'s good taste and selectivity for eternal beauty.</p>', 'uploads/product/Valentine Jewels_20250628_150443.png', NULL, 'published', '', '', NULL, 63000.00, 0.00, 0.00, '1', 0.00, 0, 0, '0', '0', '1', '2025-06-28 15:04:44', '2025-06-28 15:04:44'),
(410, 1, 9, 'Valentine Jewels', 'valentine-jewelry-6', NULL, NULL, '<p>The heart-embossed ring with tiny diamonds is a gorgeous piece of jewellery that emanates romance and elegance. The fineness of the detailing and the craftsmanship of the embossing gave the ring a gorgeous texture that provides depth and dimension to the ring. The small diamonds that trim the heart shape further add to its attractiveness, giving it a dash of sparkle and sophistication. This ring is not only jewellery, but it is also an emblem of commitment and love, and as such, the ultimate gift for that special someone or a prized element to add to any jewelry box. Its enduring style and exceptional beauty render it a genuinely memorable and extraordinary piece.</p>', 'uploads/product/Valentine Jewels_20250628_150445.png', NULL, 'published', '', '', NULL, 53000.00, 0.00, 0.00, '1', 0.00, 0, 0, '0', '0', '1', '2025-06-28 15:04:46', '2025-06-28 15:04:46'),
(411, 1, 9, 'Valentine Jewels', 'valentine-jewelry-5', NULL, NULL, '<p>Three diamond curls ring is an exquisite and refined piece of jewelry that reeks of elegance and luxury. The three diamonds are carefully mounted in a coiled pattern to form a picture of movement and flow. All three diamonds are eye-catching and gleam and shimmer, casting an eye toward the wearer\'s hand and accenting any type of clothing with glamour. This ring is the ultimate accessory for an evening out or a special night, providing an added touch of shine and refinement to any outfit.<br><br>                   With its ageless beauty and traditional design, the three diamond curls ring will become a treasured piece in every jewelry collection.</p>\n<div style=\"pointer-events: none; overflow: hidden; padding-bottom: 2px; z-index: auto; position: fixed; left: 12px; top: 84.5px; height: 10px; width: 10px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: 100%; font-size: 14px; font-size-adjust: none; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'San Francisco\', \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; text-align: start; text-transform: none; letter-spacing: normal; word-spacing: 0px; tab-size: 8;\"><br></div>', 'uploads/product/Valentine Jewels_20250628_150447.png', NULL, 'published', '', '', NULL, 55000.00, 0.00, 0.00, '1', 0.00, 0, 0, '0', '0', '1', '2025-06-28 15:04:48', '2025-06-28 15:04:48'),
(412, 1, 9, 'Valentine Jewels', 'valentine-jewelry-4', NULL, NULL, '<p>A single diamond ring can be the bearer of great meaning and value. It is a keeper of love, commitment, and forever ties. It is a promise of an eternity spent with one another, a token of a heart so full of devotion and love. The diamond shines like a star, giving evidence of all the emotion and concern that has gone into picking it. It is a reminder of the moments spent together, memories made, and a future of love and happiness. Indeed, one little diamond ring contains a world of feelings and vows, and it is a treasured and valued possession.</p>', 'uploads/product/Valentine Jewels_20250628_150449.png', NULL, 'published', '', '', NULL, 133000.00, 0.00, 0.00, '1', 0.00, 0, 0, '0', '0', '1', '2025-06-28 15:04:50', '2025-06-28 15:04:50'),
(413, 1, 9, 'Valentine Jewels', 'valentine-jewelry-3', NULL, NULL, '<p>The gold ring in the form of a snowflake is a beautiful adornment that catches the essence and subtlety of nature. Made from shiny 24 carat gold, the complex design of the ring looks like a delicate snowflake, with delicate features and a blinding sheen. The beautiful adornment is not just a statement of fashion, but also a representation of purity and elegance. The gold ring in the shape of a snowflake is the ideal wedding, party, or any occasion accessory for which you wish to make a fashion statement and get noticed by everyone. Its timelessness and sophistication are such that it is an absolute necessity in any jewellery collection.</p>', 'uploads/product/Valentine Jewels_20250628_150451.png', NULL, 'published', '', '', NULL, 65000.00, 0.00, 0.00, '1', 0.00, 0, 0, '0', '0', '1', '2025-06-28 15:04:52', '2025-06-28 15:04:52'),
