></span><span class=\"Editor_t__added__LtuNJ\">contains</span><span class=\"Editor_t__not_edited__WuRP8\"><span> </span>within<span> </span></span><span class=\"Editor_t__added__LtuNJ\">itself</span><span class=\"Editor_t__not_edited__WuRP8\"><span> </span>the promise of<span> </span></span><span class=\"Editor_t__added__LtuNJ\">eternal</span><span class=\"Editor_t__not_edited__WuRP8\"><span> </span>beauty and<span> </span></span><span class=\"Editor_t__added__LtuNJ\">grace</span><span class=\"Editor_t__not_edited__WuRP8\">.</span></p>', 'uploads/product/Valentine Jewels_20250628_150453.png', NULL, 'published', '', '', NULL, 50000.00, 0.00, 0.00, '1', 0.00, 0, 0, '0', '0', '1', '2025-06-28 15:04:55', '2025-06-28 15:04:55'),
(415, 1, 9, 'Valentine Jewels', 'valentine-jewelry-1', NULL, NULL, '<p>A love necklace is not merely a jewelry item; it is an emblem of deep and profound attachment between two people. This special piece of jewelry is a reminder of the love and affection of two people, capturing moments of happiness, laughter, and closeness. Whether received as a present or used as a token of love, the love necklace symbolizes the emotional value and sentimental worth of a relationship. Its fragile design and precious material symbolize the beauty and vulnerability of love, and it is thus a treasured and precious possession. The love necklace is more than a fashion accessory, but rather a symbol of commitment, devotion, and eternal love.</p>', 'uploads/product/Valentine Jewels_20250628_150456.png', NULL, 'published', '', '', NULL, 48000.00, 0.00, 0.00, '1', 0.00, 0, 0, '0', '0', '1', '2025-06-28 15:04:57', '2025-06-28 15:04:57'),
(416, 1, 12, 'Winter Jewels', 'winter-jewels-12', NULL, NULL, '<p><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong>EARRINGS</strong></span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">A Winter Tale, told in exquisite jewels, where every piece speaks and tells a story, some in gold, some in diamonds. Hanif Jewellery &amp; Watches invites you to take this journey through the cold with the warmth of artistic expression and a vision of sparkling breathtaking &amp; timeless jewels.</span></p>', 'uploads/product/Winter Jewels_20250628_150600.jpg', NULL, 'published', '', 'The Winter’s Tale unfolds in the form of exquisite jewels, where every creation whispers a story, some told in gold, others in diamonds. Hanif Jewellery & Watches, Pakistan\'s top jewellers, invites you on a journey through the chill of winter, warmed by artistic expression and a vision brought to life in sparkling, breathtaking, and timeless pieces. Let each jewel be a chapter in your enchanting tale.', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, '1', 0.00, 0, 0, '0', '0', '0', '2025-06-28 15:06:00', '2025-06-28 15:06:00'),
