(589, 3, 23, 'Moon', 'moon-lm-45-10-mo-bb', NULL, NULL, '<p><span data-sheets-userformat=\'{\"2\":513,\"3\":{\"1\":0},\"12\":0}\' data-sheets-value=\'{\"1\":2,\"2\":\"In honour of the memory of its illustrious founder – and on the occasion of the tenth anniversary of its rebirth – Ateliers Louis Moinet unveils a visionary creation, positioning the chronograph not simply as a complication – but as a central component of the watch. Memoris is the first chronograph in the history of watchmaking to be both fun and educational.\"}\'>In honour of the memory of its illustrious founder – and on the occasion of the tenth anniversary of its rebirth – Ateliers Louis Moinet unveils a visionary creation, positioning the chronograph not simply as a complication – but as a central component of the watch.</span></p>\n<p><span data-sheets-userformat=\'{\"2\":513,\"3\":{\"1\":0},\"12\":0}\' data-sheets-value=\'{\"1\":2,\"2\":\"In honour of the memory of its illustrious founder – and on the occasion of the tenth anniversary of its rebirth – Ateliers Louis Moinet unveils a visionary creation, positioning the chronograph not simply as a complication – but as a central component of the watch. Memoris is the first chronograph in the history of watchmaking to be both fun and educational.\"}\'> Memoris is the first chronograph in the history of watchmaking to be both fun and educational.</span><br></p>\n<p><span data-sheets-userformat=\'{\"2\":513,\"3\":{\"1\":0},\"12\":0}\' data-sheets-value=\'{\"1\":2,\"2\":\"In honour of the memory of its illustrious founder – and on the occasion of the tenth anniversary of its rebirth – Ateliers Louis Moinet unveils a visionary creation, positioning the chronograph not simply as a complication – but as a central component of the watch. Memoris is the first chronograph in the history of watchmaking to be both fun and educational.\"}\'>Dial color: Gray<br>Luminescence: Yes<br>Case size: 43.2mm<br>Case material: Stainless Steel<br>Case back: Closed<br>Strap material: Alligator<br>Strap color: Black, Gray<br>Buckle type: Folding Clasp<br>Special Features<br>Water resistance 50m/5 bar</span></p>\n<div class=\"glass\">\n<ul></ul>\n</div>\n<ul></ul>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>', 'uploads/product/Moon_20250628_154127.png', NULL, 'published', '', '', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, '1', 0.00, 0, 0, '0', '0', '0', '2025-06-28 15:41:29', '2025-06-28 15:41:29'),
(590, 3, 23, 'Memoris', 'memoris_lm-54-50-25-bb', NULL, NULL, '<p>In honour of the memory of its illustrious founder – and on the occasion of the tenth anniversary of its rebirth – Ateliers Louis Moinet unveils a visionary creation, positioning the chronograph not simply as a complication – but as a central component of the watch.</p>\n<p><span data-sheets-userformat=\'{\"2\":513,\"3\":{\"1\":0},\"12\":0}\' data-sheets-value=\'{\"1\":2,\"2\":\"In honour of the memory of its illustrious founder – and on the occasion of the tenth anniversary of its rebirth – Ateliers Louis Moinet unveils a visionary creation, positioning the chronograph not simply as a complication – but as a central component of the watch. Memoris is the first chronograph in the history of watchmaking to be both fun and educational.\"}\'><strong>Limited edition of 12 watches</strong><br>Case:18K Rose Gold<br>Case Back:Exhibition Case Back<br>Case:Width 46mm<br>Crystal:Sapphire Crystal<br>Dial Color:Blue<br>Functions:Hours, Minutes, Chronograph<br>Movement:Automatic<br>Water Resistance:50M<br>Bracelet Strap:Alligator leather<br>Clasp Type:Folding clasp<br></span></p>\n<div class=\"glass\">\n<ul></ul>\n</div>\n<ul></ul>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>', 'uploads/product/Memoris_20250628_154130.png', NULL, 'published', '', '', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, '1', 0.00, 0, 0, '0', '0', '0', '2025-06-28 15:41:31', '2025-06-28 15:41:31'),
(591, 3, 23, 'Mars', 'mars-lm-45-10-ma-bb', NULL, NULL, '<p class=\"mb-2\"><strong>Limited edition of 60 pieces</strong></p>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<p><span data-sheets-userformat=\'{\"2\":513,\"3\":{\"1\":0},\"12\":0}\' data-sheets-value=\'{\"1\":2,\"2\":\"A fragment of Mars on the wrist This unique creation by Louis Moinet enshrines an extraordinary spaceborne adventure. The collection (comprising 12 pieces in rose gold and 60 in steel) features a genuine Mars meteorite fragment in a capsule at the three o’clock position, amid a dial that faithfully reproduces the surface of Mars, complete with its legendary volcanoes.\"}\'>A fragment of Mars on the wrist This unique creation by Louis Moinet enshrines an extraordinary spaceborne adventure.</span></p>\n<p><span data-sheets-userformat=\'{\"2\":513,\"3\":{\"1\":0},\"12\":0}\' data-sheets-value=\'{\"1\":2,\"2\":\"A fragment of Mars on the wrist This unique creation by Louis Moinet enshrines an extraordinary spaceborne adventure. The collection (comprising 12 pieces in rose gold and 60 in steel) features a genuine Mars meteorite fragment in a capsule at the three o’clock position, amid a dial that faithfully reproduces the surface of Mars, complete with its legendary volcanoes.\"}\'> The collection (comprising 12 pieces in rose gold and 60 in steel) features a genuine Mars meteorite fragment in a capsule at the three o’clock position, amid a dial that faithfully reproduces the surface of Mars, complete with its legendary volcanoes.</span><br></p>\n<p><span data-sheets-userformat=\'{\"2\":513,\"3\":{\"1\":0},\"12\":0}\' data-sheets-value=\'{\"1\":2,\"2\":\"A fragment of Mars on the wrist This unique creation by Louis Moinet enshrines an extraordinary spaceborne adventure. The collection (comprising 12 pieces in rose gold and 60 in steel) features a genuine Mars meteorite fragment in a capsule at the three o’clock position, amid a dial that faithfully reproduces the surface of Mars, complete with its legendary volcanoes.\"}\'>Dial color: Brown<br>Luminescence: Yes<br>Case size: 43.2mm<br>Case material: Stainless Steel<br>Case back: Closed<br>Strap material: Alligator<br>Strap color: Black, Brown<br>Buckle type: Folding Clasp<br>Special Features<br>Water resistance 50m/5 bar</span></p>\n<div class=\"glass\">\n<ul></ul>\n</div>\n<ul></ul>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>', 'uploads/product/Mars_20250628_154132.png', NULL, 'published', '', '', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, '1', 0.00, 0, 0, '0', '0', '0', '2025-06-28 15:41:34', '2025-06-28 15:41:34'),
(592, 3, 23, 'Memoris Original', 'louismoinetmemorisoriginalgreen', NULL, NULL, '<p><span>Picture yourself being the head of the contemporary version of a brand owned by a watchmaker from the 1700s and 1800s — and then you find out a new historical fact that is potentially game-changing. The wristwatch prestige world is often constructed chronologically, i.e., who did something earliest or who is the oldest. As empty as some classic accomplishments are in their application to today\'s brand credibility, the emotional significance of such awards is enormous — and Louis Moinet was fortunate enough to land in their lap. The Louis Moinet Memoris chronograph watch is the product that came out of that situation.<br><br>The Memoris Original lineup by Louis Moinet,</span><span> A spectacular and innovative chronograph, displaying the 147 elements of the chronograph function on the dial side.<br><br></span></p>\n<p><strong>Main Features to Note:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Limited Edition:</strong> Yes<br><strong>Gender:</strong> Male<br><strong>Dial Size:</strong> 46mm<br><strong>Case Material: </strong>18K Red Gold<br><strong>Strap: </strong>Alligator Strap<br><strong>Functions: </strong>Chronographs<br><strong>Movement: </strong>Automatic<br><strong>Glass: </strong>Sapphire Glass<br><strong>Frequency: </strong>4 Hz / 2800 vibrations per hour<br><strong>Power Reserve: </strong>48 hours<br><strong>Water Resistance:</strong> 50m<br><strong>International Warranty: </strong>2 years</p>\n<p><span><br></span></p>', 'uploads/product/Memoris Original_20250628_154135.jpg', NULL, 'published', 'Louis Moinet Memoris', 'The Memoris collection by @louismoinet. A stunning and revolutionary chronograph, showing the 147 components of the chronograph function on the dial side. Key Features to Observe: Limited Edition: YesGender: MaleDial Size: 46mmCase Material: 18K Red GoldStrap: Alligator StrapFunctions: ChronographsMovement: AutomaticGlass: Sapphire Glass Frequency: 4 Hz / 2800 vibrations per hour Power Reserve: 48 hoursWater Resistance: 50mInternational Warranty: 2 years', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, '1', 0.00, 0, 0, '0', '0', '0', '2025-06-28 15:41:38', '2025-06-28 15:41:38'),
