(695, 3, 25, 'CH-8763-BKRE', 'ch-8763-bkre', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'uploads/product/CH-8763-BKRE_20250630_082222.jpg', NULL, 'published', 'Chronoswiss watch CH-8763-BKRE', 'The domed day/night display definitely is an eye-catcher. The stars on the night side even glow in the dark thanks to their Super-LumiNova coating; a feature that is not just for romantics! To get to know the Chronoswiss Watches Price in Pakistan contact us.', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, '1', 0.00, 0, 0, '0', '0', '0', '2025-06-30 08:22:22', '2025-07-22 09:33:15'),
