(699, 3, 25, 'CH-7543L', 'ch7543l', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'uploads/product/ch7543l.png', NULL, 'published', 'Chronoswiss Watches - CH7543L', 'Model CH7543L of Chronoswiss is a fine piece which displays lunar sub dial, not just this but also has 3 other sub dials that display seconds and sub seconds. To get to know the Chronoswiss Watches Price in Pakistan contact us.', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, '1', 0.00, 0, 0, '0', '0', '0', '2025-06-30 08:22:30', '2025-07-22 09:36:43'),
