(876, 3, 32, 'VEZ800321', 'vez800321', NULL, NULL, '<div class=\"product-description\">Striking with a bold twist, the Swiss-made VEM927 chronograph watch boasts a masculine 43 mm dial surrounded by a ring. At the 12h position are placed the Medusa head and Versace logo. The dial on two levels gives a sophisticated design, in line with the watch making standards of a men target, more attentive to the details and performances given by the chrono movement with date at 4 o\'clock. The 3 counters in contrast stand out inside the dial and emphasize the uniqueness and exclusiveness of the details. See through indexes and the Greca pattern circles the watch face.<br><br>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product-description\"></div>\n<div class=\"product-description\">\n<div class=\"product-description\">\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div class=\"tab-content\">\n<div class=\"tab-pane active\">\n<div class=\"product-description\">\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div class=\"tab-content\">\n<div id=\"proTabs1\" class=\"tab-pane active\">\n<p><strong><u>Main Features to Note:</u></strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product-description\">\n<div class=\"tab-content\">\n<div class=\"tab-pane active\" id=\"proTabs1\">\n<p><strong>Gender:<span> </span></strong>Men<strong><br>Reference:</strong><span>  VEZ800321</span><br><strong>Dial Size:</strong><span> 43 mm<br><strong>Case Material:</strong>  Stainless Steel<br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <strong>Glass: </strong>Sapphire<br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Water Resistance: </strong>50 meters</span><br><strong>Movement:</strong> Quartz<br><strong>International Warranty:</strong><span> 2 years</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<ul></ul>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!-