(879, 3, 32, 'VEZ700622', 'vez700622', NULL, NULL, '<div class=\"product-description\">Transparent black IP stainless steel case with a transparent black IP silicone strap. Fixed transparent black IP stainless steel bezel. Black dial with black hands and index hour markers. Medusa head marks the 12 o\'clock position. Minute markers around the outer rim. Dial Type: Analog. Date display at the 6 o\'clock position. Chronograph - two sub-dials displaying: 60 second and 30 minute. Quartz movement. Scratch resistant sapphire crystal. Pull / push crown. Solid case back. Round case shape, case size: 44 mm. Tang clasp. Water resistant at 50 meters / 165 feet. Functions: chronograph, date, hour, minute, second. Icon Active Series. Sport watch style. Watch label: Swiss Made. Versace Icon Active Chronograph Quartz Black Dial Men\'s Watch VEZ700622.<br><br>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product-description\"></div>\n<div class=\"product-description\">\n<div class=\"product-description\">\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div class=\"tab-content\">\n<div class=\"tab-pane active\">\n<div class=\"product-description\">\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div class=\"tab-content\">\n<div id=\"proTabs1\" class=\"tab-pane active\">\n<p><strong><u>Main Features to Note:</u></strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product-description\">\n<div class=\"tab-content\">\n<div class=\"tab-pane active\" id=\"proTabs1\">\n<p><strong>Gender:<span> </span></strong>Men<strong><br>Reference:</strong><span>  VEZ700622</span><br><strong>Dial Size:</strong><span> 44 mm<br><strong>Case Material:</strong> Stainless Steel<br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <strong>Glass:</strong> Scratch Resistant Sapphire<br><strong>Clasp:</strong> Tang<br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Water Resistance: </strong>50 meters</span><br><strong>Movement:</strong> Quartz<br><strong>International Warranty:</strong><span> 2 years</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<ul></ul>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>', 'uploads/product/VEZ700622_20250630_084249.jpg', NULL, 'draft', 'Hanif Jewellery and Watches - V-PALAZZO WATCH', 'A sporty take on an iconic design, this classic watch features a ’floating’ three-dimensional champagne Medusa on the black dial encircled with the Greca pattern. ', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, '1', 0.00, 0, 0, '0', '0', '0', '2025-06-30 08:42:50', '2025-06-30 08:42:50'),
(880, 3, 32, 'VEZ600421', 'vez600421', NULL, NULL, '<div class=\"product-description\">Both practical and decorative, this Ronda 762 Swiss quartz watch with two hand movement and with a 36 mm dial features a Medusa head and Versace logo at the 12h position surrounded by the signature Greca pattern. The Greca icon is a decoration all over across the bracelet as well as all around the top ring and on the dial. Enriched with details such as the wonderful guilloche in the dial and the Greca and Versace logo on the right, this watch is extremely evergreen and incredibly feminine.<br><br>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product-description\"></div>\n<div class=\"product-description\">\n<div class=\"product-description\">\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div class=\"tab-content\">\n<div class=\"tab-pane active\">\n<div class=\"product-description\">\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div class=\"tab-content\">\n<div id=\"proTabs1\" class=\"tab-pane active\">\n<p><strong><u>Main Features to Note:</u></strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product-description\">\n<div class=\"tab-content\">\n<div class=\"tab-pane active\" id=\"proTabs1\">\n<p><strong>Gender:<span> </span></strong>Ladies<strong><br>Reference:</strong><span>  VEZ600421</span><br><strong>Dial Size:</strong><span> 36 mm<br><strong>Case Material:</strong> Stainless Steel<br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <strong>Glass:</strong> Sapphire <br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Water Resistance: </strong>50 meters</span><br><strong>Movement:</strong> Quartz<br><strong>International Warranty:</strong><span> 2 years</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<ul></ul>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n