(889, 3, 32, 'VET300621', 'vet300621', NULL, NULL, '<div class=\"product-description\">The Versace ladies watch VET300621 is a modern companion from the model series V-Virtus 28mm. A perfect choice if you are looking for a timepiece with a contemporary look.<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\">The watch has a silver case, made of stainless steel, which looks like a real eye-catcher thanks to the matted, polished surface.<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\">The round case is 28 mm wide and 8 mm height and, depending on individual taste, will adorn almost any wrist. The bezel, which is fixed, stands out discreetly from the case. The case back of the watch is a stainless steel bottom, pressed, which sets the final point for a coherent design.<br><br>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product-description\"></div>\n<div class=\"product-description\">\n<div class=\"product-description\">\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div class=\"tab-content\">\n<div class=\"tab-pane active\">\n<div class=\"product-description\">\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div class=\"tab-content\">\n<div class=\"tab-pane active\" id=\"proTabs1\">\n<p><strong><u>Main Features to Note:</u></strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product-description\">\n<div class=\"tab-content\">\n<div id=\"proTabs1\" class=\"tab-pane active\">\n<p><strong>Gender:<span> </span></strong>Ladies<strong><br>Reference:</strong><span>  VET300621</span><br><strong>Dial Size:</strong><span> 28 mm<br><strong>Case Material:</strong> Stainless Steel<br><strong>Clasp: </strong>Butterfly<br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Water Resistance: </strong>5 ATM<br><strong>Glass:</strong> Sapphire</span><br><strong>Movement:</strong> Quartz<br><strong>International Warranty:</strong><span> 2 years</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<ul></ul>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<st