(896, 3, 32, 'VEPM00520', 'vepm00520', NULL, NULL, '<div class=\"product-description\">\n<div class=\"product-description\">\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div class=\"tab-content\">\n<div class=\"tab-pane active\">\n<div class=\"product-description\">\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div class=\"tab-content\">\n<div id=\"proTabs1\" class=\"tab-pane active\">\n<p>Silver-tone stainless steel case with a two-tone (silver-tone and gold-tone) stainless steel bracelet. Fixed black stainless steel bezel showing tachymeter markings. Silver dial with gold-tone hands and index hour markers. Minute markers around the outer rim. Tachymeter around the bezel. Dial Type: Analog. Date display at the 4 o\'clock position. Chronograph - three sub-dials displaying: 60 second, 30 minute and 1/10th of a second. Quartz movement. Scratch resistant sapphire crystal. Pull / push crown. Solid case back. Round case shape, case size: 45 mm. Deployment clasp. Water resistant at 50 meters / 165 feet. Functions: chronograph, date, hour, minute, second. Greca Chrono Series. Sport watch style. Watch label: Swiss Made. Versace Greca Chronograph Quartz Silver Dial Men\'s Watch VEPM00520.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<div class=\"product-description\">\n<div class=\"tab-content\">\n<div class=\"tab-pane active\" id=\"proTabs1\">\n<p><strong><u>Main Features to Note:<br></u></strong><strong><br>Gender:<span> </span></strong>Men<strong><br>Reference: