(899, 3, 32, 'VE2W00322', 've2w00322', NULL, NULL, '<div class=\"product-description\">\n<div class=\"product-description\">\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div class=\"tab-content\">\n<div class=\"tab-pane active\">\n<div class=\"product-description\">\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div class=\"tab-content\">\n<div class=\"tab-pane active\" id=\"proTabs1\">\n<p>he sport tech becomes GMT with a new movement that restyles the watch design. The 45mm case body features a 3D Medusa at 12H, bold indexes and a unique Greca pattern all over the dial. The middle case is open to show the different type of case finishing.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<div class=\"product-description\">\n<div class=\"tab-content\">\n<div id=\"proTabs1\" class=\"tab-pane active\">\n<p><strong><u>Main Features to Note:<br></u></strong><strong><br>Gender:<span> </span></strong>Men<strong><br>Reference:</strong><span>  VE2W00322</span><br><strong>Dial Size:</strong><span> 45 mm<br><strong>Case Material:</strong> Stainless Steel<br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Water Resistance: </strong>5 ATM</span><br><strong>Movement:</strong> Quartz<br><strong>International Warranty:</strong><span> 2 years</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"product-single__price product-single__price-nov-product-template d-flex align-items-center\"><br></p>\n</div>\n<ul></ul>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-