(901, 3, 32, 'VE2U00522', 've2u00522', NULL, NULL, '<div class=\"product-description\">\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div class=\"tab-content\">A contemporary reimagination , the Hellenyium Chrono takes inspiration from the original Hellenyium line. This sporty timepiece embellished with an emblematic, gold-tone Medusa and Greca accents. The watch features chronograph movement with three counters on the green dial with a champagne case. Finished with a stainless steel and champagne wristband.<br><br><br> <strong><u>Main Features to Note:<br></u></strong><strong><br>Gender:<span> </span></strong>Men<strong><br>Reference:</strong><span>  VE2U00522</span><br><strong>Dial Size:</strong><span> 43mm<br><strong>Case Material:</strong> Stainless Steel<br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Water Resistance: </strong>5 ATM</span><br><strong>Movement:</strong> Quartz<br><strong>Bracelet:</strong> Bico(SS&amp;IP Champagne) band with buckle with pushers<br><strong>International Warranty:</strong><span> 2 years</span>\n</div>\n<br>\n</div>\n<ul></ul>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>', 'uploads/product/VE2U00522_20250630_084504.jpg', NULL, 'draft', 'Hanif Jewellery and Watches - V-PALAZZO WATCH', 'A sporty take on an iconic design, this classic watch features a ’floating’ three-dimensional champagne Medusa on the black dial encircled with the Greca pattern. ', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, '1', 0.00, 0, 0, '0', '0', '0', '2025-06-30 08:45:05', '2025-06-30 08:45:05'),
(902, 3, 32, 'VE2U00122', 've2u00122', NULL, NULL, '<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div class=\"tab-content\">\n<div class=\"tab-pane active\" id=\"proTabs1\">Versace has introduced a new version on the well-known Hellenyium watch. This bold 44 mm case is a mix between a sporty and chic watch. The iconic and ever green collection is now presented with a chronograph movement with three counters that enrich this precious dial. In addition to this, the Greca embellishes the outer dial and at 12 o\'clock stands the fierce Medusa head. To flag, the genuine leather strap with canvas, adds a new sport-luxury concept with a matching dial. <br>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tab-pane active\"></div>\n<div class=\"tab-pane active\">\n<br><strong><u>Main Features to Note:<br></u></strong><strong><br>Gender:<span> </span></strong>Men<strong><br>Reference:</strong><span>  VE2T00122</span><br><strong>Dial Size:</strong><span> 44mm<br><strong>Case Material:</strong> Stainless Steel<br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Water Resistance: </strong>50 metres<br></span><strong>Strap Type:</strong> Leather<br><strong>Movement:</strong> Quartz<br><strong>Glass: </strong>Sapphire<br><strong>International Warranty:</strong><span> 2 years</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<br>\n<ul></ul>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>', 'uploads/product/VE2U00122_20250630_084506.jpg', NULL, 'draft', 'Hanif Jewellery and Watches - V-PALAZZO WATCH', 'A sporty take on an iconic design, this classic watch features a ’floating’ three-dimensional champagne Medusa on the black dial encircled with the Greca pattern. ', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, '1', 0.00, 0, 0, '0', '0', '0', '2025-06-30 08:45:07', '2025-06-30 08:45:07'),
(903, 3, 32, 'VE2T00622', 've2t00622', NULL, NULL, '<div class=\"product-description\">\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div class=\"tab-content\">\n<div class=\"tab-pane active\" id=\"proTabs1\">\n<p>This iconic 42mm watch has an incredible and innovative design characterized by a dome shaped glass and bold top ring with Versace lettering and Greca finishing. The dial features a 3 hand movement, bold indexes to give strong personality, a Versace logo pattern to celebrate the brand and the 3D Medusa head at 12H. The collection is features a Versace logo embossed leather strap.</p>\n<p><strong><u><br>Main Features to Note:<br></u></strong><strong><br>Gender:<span> </span></strong>Men<strong><br>Reference:</strong><span>  VE2T00622</span><br><strong>Dial Size:</strong><span> 42mm<br><strong>Case Material:</strong> Stainless Steel<br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Water Resistance: </strong>50 metres<br></span><strong>Buckle: </strong>Ardillon<br><strong>Movement:</strong> Quartz<br><strong>Glass: </strong>Sapphire<br><strong>International Warranty:</strong><span> 2 years</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"product-single__price product-single__price-nov-product-template d-flex align-items-center\"><br></p>\n</div>\n<ul></ul>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>', 'uploads/product/VE2T00622_20250630_084508.jpg', NULL, 'draft', 'Hanif Jewellery and Watches - V-PALAZZO WATCH', 'A sporty take on an iconic design, this classic watch features a ’floating’ three-dimensional champagne Medusa on the black dial encircled with the Greca pattern. ', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, '1', 0.00, 0, 0, '0', '0', '0', '2025-06-30 08:45:09', '2025-06-30 08:45:09'),
(904, 3, 32, 'VE2T00122', 've2t00122', NULL, NULL, '<div class=\"product-description\">\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div class=\"tab-content\">\n<div class=\"tab-pane active\" id=\"proTabs1\">\n<p>This iconic 42mm watch has an incredible and innovative design characterized by a dome shaped glass and bold top ring with Versace lettering and Greca finishing. The dial features a 3 hand movement, bold indexes to give strong personality, a Versace logo pattern to celebrate the brand and the 3D Medusa head at 12H. The collection is features a Versace logo embossed leather strap.</p>\n<p><strong><u><br>Main Features to Note:<br></u></strong><strong><br>Gender:<span> </span></strong>Men<strong><br>Reference:</strong><span>  VE2T00122</span><br><strong>Dial Size:</strong><span> 42mm<br><strong>Case Material:</strong> Stainless Steel<br></span><strong>Buckle: </strong>Ardillon<br><strong>Movement:</strong> Quartz<br><strong>International Warranty:</strong><span> 2 years</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"product-single__price product-single__price-nov-product-template d-flex align-items-center\"><br></p>\n</div>\n<ul></ul>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>', 'uploads/product/VE2T00122_20250630_084511.jpg', NULL, 'draft', 'Hanif Jewellery and Watches - V-PALAZZO WATCH', 'A sporty take on an iconic design, this classic watch features a ’floating’ three-dimensional champagne Medusa on the black dial encircled with the Greca pattern. ', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, '1', 0.00, 0, 0, '0', '0', '0', '2025-06-30 08:45:11', '2025-06-30 08:45:11'),
(905, 3, 32, 'VE2S00622', 've2s00622', NULL, NULL, '<div class=\"product-description\">\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div class=\"tab-content\">\n<div id=\"proTabs1\" class=\"tab-pane active\">\n<p>Versace Hellenyium (Lady) VE2S00622 is a beautiful and attractive Ladies watch. Case material is Stainless Steel and the Black dial gives the watch that unique look. This model has got 50 metres water resistancy - it can be submerged in water for periods.</p>\n<p><strong><u><br>Main Features to Note:<br></u></strong><strong><br>Gender:<span> </span></strong>Ladies<strong><br>Reference:</strong><span>  VE2S00622</span><br><strong>Dial Size:</strong><span> 36 mm<br><strong>Case Material:</strong> Stainless Steel<br><strong>Water Resistance: </strong>50 metres</span><br><strong>Glass: </strong>Sapphire<br><strong>Strap:</strong> Metal Bracelet<br><strong>Movement:</strong> Quartz<br><strong>International Warranty:</strong><span> 2 years</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"product-single__price product-single__price-nov-product-template d-flex align-items-center\"><br></p>\n</div>\n<ul></ul>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>', 'uploads/product/VE2S00622_20250630_084513.jpg', NULL, 'draft', 'Hanif Jewellery and Watches - V-PALAZZO WATCH', 'A sporty take on an iconic design, this classic watch features a ’floating’ three-dimensional champagne Medusa on the black dial encircled with the Greca pattern. ', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, '1', 0.00, 0, 0, '0', '0', '0', '2025-06-30 08:45:13', '2025-06-30 08:45:13'),
(906, 3, 32, 'VE2R00222', 've2r00222', NULL, NULL, '<div class=\"product-description\">\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div class=\"tab-content\">\n<div class=\"tab-pane active\" id=\"proTabs1\">\n<p>This elegant watch is characterized by a delicate yet recognizable Greca. The 30 mm case is enriched with a 3D Medusa at 12 o\'clock and a 3D Greca pattern all over the dial. This eye-catching pattern also refines the stainless steel bracelet, giving a chic look and feel to the watch. The IP Champagne version is the only one with diamonds as indexes, to further enrich this beautiful timepiece.</p>\n<p><strong><u>Main Features to Note:<br></u></strong><strong><br>Gender:<span> </span></strong>Ladies<strong><br>Reference:</strong><span>  VE2R00222</span><br><strong>Dial Size:</strong><span> 38 mm<br><strong>Case Material:</strong> Stainless Steel<br><strong>Water Resistance: </strong>30 metres</span><br><strong>Glass: </strong>Sapphire<br><strong>Strap:</strong> Metal Bracelet<br><strong>Movement:</strong> Quartz<br><strong>International Warranty:</strong><span> 2 years</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"product-single__price product-single__price-nov-product-template d-flex align-items-center\"><br></p>\n</div>\n<ul></ul>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>', 'uploads/product/VE2R00222_20250630_084515.jpg', NULL, 'draft', 'Hanif Jewellery and Watches - V-PALAZZO WATCH', 'A sporty take on an iconic design, this classic watch features a ’floating’ three-dimensional champagne Medusa on the black dial encircled with the Greca pattern. ', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, '1', 0.00, 0, 0, '0', '0', '0', '2025-06-30 08:45:16', '2025-06-30 08:45:16'),
(907, 3, 32, 'VE2Q00622', 've2q00622', NULL, NULL, '<div class=\"product-description\">\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div class=\"tab-content\">\n<div class=\"tab-pane active\" id=\"proTabs1\">\n<p>This elegant watch is characterized by a delicate yet recognizable Greca. The 30 mm case is enriched with a 3D Medusa at 12 o\'clock and a 3D Greca pattern all over the dial. This eye-catching pattern also refines the stainless steel bracelet, giving a chic look and feel to the watch. The IP Champagne version is the only one with diamonds as indexes, to further enrich this beautiful timepiece.</p>\n<p><strong><u>Main Features to Note:<br></u></strong><strong><br>Gender:<span> </span></strong>Ladies<strong><br>Reference:</strong><span>  VE2Q00622</span><br><strong>Dial Size:</strong><span> 30 mm<br><strong>Case Material:</strong> Stainless Steel<br><strong>Water Resistance: </strong>30 metres</span><br><strong>Glass: </strong>Sapphire<br><strong>Strap:</strong> Leather <br><strong>Buckle: </strong>Deployant<br><strong>Movement:</strong> Quartz<br><strong>International Warranty:</strong><span> 2 years</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"product-single__price product-single__price-nov-product-template d-flex align-items-center\"><br></p>\n</div>\n<ul></ul>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>', 'uploads/product/VE2Q00622_20250630_084517.jpg', NULL, 'draft', 'Hanif Jewellery and Watches - V-PALAZZO WATCH', 'A sporty take on an iconic design, this classic watch features a ’floating’